## Problem classes

### `Shizuku installed but state stays not-installed`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Shevery is on the device and B-LAN says install Shizuku | Detector only checked `moe.shizuku.privileged.api` | Use the known-package list, then the permission / provider / receiver scan. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `pm grant WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS still returns no PSK`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Grant succeeds and the passphrase is null | That permission is not the Wi-Fi secret capability | Call the privileged WifiManager methods on the Shizuku binder. Android 11+ shell uid is what can see them. |

